Tool of the Week.

53
00:07:54,280 --> 00:07:59,105
Grok Bot – xAI's "always-on" AI teammate exits beta.

54
00:07:59,105 --> 00:08:06,668
Grok Bot logs into existing tools on its own, completes tasks end-to-end, and only checks back in when approval is needed .

55
00:08:06,668 --> 00:08:16,568
After a beta launch on August 11, the service has been available on Mac, iOS, Windows, and Linux since August 21, with Android to follow .

56
00:08:16,568 --> 00:08:25,455
Particularly useful for teams looking to automate recurring multi-tool workflows, since the bots remember conversations and learn preferences over time .

57
00:08:25,455 --> 00:08:39,355
Grok Bot is included in SuperGrok Plus/Heavy as well as Cursor Pro+/Ultra/Teams – originally available only for SuperGrok Heavy and Cursor Ultra/Teams Premium, now rolled out more broadly .

58
00:08:39,355 --> 00:08:44,680
"Bots sign in to your tools, use them just like you do, and come back with finished work."

