00:08:45,993 --> 00:08:47,143
Fail of the Week.

61
00:08:47,143 --> 00:08:50,205
"Claude is down – and nobody quite knows why"

62
00:08:50,205 --> 00:09:09,130
On August 16, Claude.ai, Claude Code, Claude Cowork, and platform.claude.com went down for about 42 minutes (21:58-22:40 UTC) – login problems, loading errors, and hanging requests affected multiple services simultaneously .

63
00:09:09,130 --> 00:09:15,943
Claude Console and the API remained available, suggesting a contained issue in the auth or frontend layer .

64
00:09:15,943 --> 00:09:25,580
Root Cause: Anthropic initially investigated authentication issues, later general performance degradation – the exact technical cause was not published .

65
00:09:25,682 --> 00:09:41,332
What we learn: Anyone building production workflows on Claude Code or Cowork should plan a fallback path via the API or a secondary model – even established providers with a "major outage" classification don't always deliver a public root-cause analysis.

